  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Post-penal programme for reintegration, rehabilitation and resocialisation of convicted persons</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The overall objective of the action aims for Institutions to contribute to reducing and prevention of recidivism through rehabilitation, reintegration and social inclusion of offenders. The specific objectives are to improve post-penal practices for rehabilitation, resocialisation and reintegration of convicted persons, and to stimulate citizens to break the tradition of stigmatising ex-convicts.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
